# 燼淵 Ashen Abyss — what stays out of the repository.
# Binary assets (models, textures, audio, fonts, renders) are published as archives attached to each GitHub release,
# not in the repository. Their Godot .import files (text) ARE committed, so the asset archive drops straight in.

